    <bpmn:process id="W_W4049" name="W4049. Operational Excellence Strategy, Charter &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; annual strategy refresh; CEO/Board mandate
Frequency: Annual + on strategic change
Volume: Enterprise program (1 OpEx function serving 5 entities)
Owner: COO / CHRO
Participants: COO, CFO (links to VS-17.4), CIO (links to VS-27), CHRO (links to VS-103), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), PMO (links to VS-112), all function VPs
Source: workflow W4049 — Operational Excellence Strategy, Charter &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4049_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4049_Lane1" name="COO Office">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4049_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4049_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
