        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4049_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4049_Lane3" name="CEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4049_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4049_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4049_Start5" name="Program stand-up; annual strategy refresh; CEO/Board mandate">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4049_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4049_Task6" name="COO define the operating model: a centralized OpEx CoE with embedded…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: COO define the operating model: a centralized OpEx CoE with embedded improvement leads in Stores, DC, Supply Chain, Finance; the relationship to audit findings (VS-21), the PMO (VS-112), innovation (VS-30), and HR/OCM (VS-134); and the value-driver targets (margin, turns, cycle-time, NPS)
Responsible (R): COO Office (OpEx CoE)
Accountable (A): CEO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4049_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4049_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4049_Task7" name="COO author the charter: scope (all cross-functional processes), decision…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: COO author the charter: scope (all cross-functional processes), decision rights, the improvement-pipeline governance, and the benefit-realization accountability to Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): COO / Finance
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4049_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4049_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4049_Task8" name="CEO/Board ratify the OpEx charter, approve resourcing, and set it as a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CEO/Board ratify the OpEx charter, approve resourcing, and set it as a board-level performance lever (links to VS-36 governance and VS-33 corporate performance)
Responsible (R): CEO / Board
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4049_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4049_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4049_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4049_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4049_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-629 (ensure controlled execution — OpEx Strategy, Governance &amp; Improvement Methodology (PA-133.1).) | - CTL governance: OpEx charter and value targets approved by Board; benefit realization reconciled by Finance (segregation between OpEx sponsor and Finance verifier)
Owner: COO / CHRO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
