    <bpmn:process id="W_W4051" name="W4051. Continuous Improvement Methodology Standards (Lean / Six Sigma / Kaizen)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; methodology refresh
Frequency: Maintained + periodic refresh
Volume: Enterprise methodology (DMAIC, DMEDI, Kaizen, value-stream mapping)
Owner: COO / Master Black Belt
Participants: OpEx CoE, all trained Belts, Quality (links to VS-31), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W4051 — Continuous Improvement Methodology Standards (Lean / Six Sigma / Kaizen)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4051_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4051_Lane1" name="Master Black Belt">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4051_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4051_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
