      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4051_Start5" name="Program stand-up; methodology refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4051_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4051_Task6" name="OpEx define the CI methodology standards: Lean (value-stream mapping, 5S…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OpEx define the CI methodology standards: Lean (value-stream mapping, 5S, standard work, waste elimination), Six Sigma (DMAIC for improvement, DMEDI for design), Kaizen (rapid events), and the project-selection criteria
Responsible (R): Master Black Belt / OpEx CoE
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4051_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4051_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4051_Task7" name="OpEx codify toolkits, templates (charter, SIPOC, control chart, A3), and the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OpEx codify toolkits, templates (charter, SIPOC, control chart, A3), and the stage-gate (Define→Measure→Analyze→Improve→Control) that gates every improvement project (links to W4053)
Responsible (R): OpEx CoE
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4051_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4051_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4051_Task8" name="OpEx integrate the methodology with quality (links to VS-31) and audit (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OpEx integrate the methodology with quality (links to VS-31) and audit (links to VS-21), and refresh based on lessons learned (W4071)
Responsible (R): OpEx / Quality / Audit
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4051_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4051_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4051_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4051_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
