    <bpmn:process id="W_W4052" name="W4052. Improvement Opportunity Pipeline &amp; Prioritization (Impact-Effort)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous (intake) + monthly review
Frequency: Continuous intake; monthly prioritization
Volume: Enterprise pipeline (hundreds of opportunities/yr from stores, DC, functions, audit, VOC)
Owner: COO
Participants: OpEx CoE, process owners, Internal Audit (links to VS-21), CX/VOC (links to VS-13/VS-44), Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4052 — Improvement Opportunity Pipeline &amp; Prioritization (Impact-Effort)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4052_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4052_Lane1" name="OpEx CoE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4052_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4052_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4052_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
