    <bpmn:process id="W_W4056" name="W4056. Continuous Improvement Culture, Suggestion System &amp; Recognition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program stand-up; ongoing
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~6,932 employees + contingent (links to VS-98); frontline suggestion volume
Owner: COO / CHRO
Participants: OpEx CoE, HR (links to VS-103), Internal Comms (links to VS-103.1), store/DC leadership
Source: workflow W4056 — Continuous Improvement Culture, Suggestion System &amp; Recognition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4056_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4056_Lane1" name="OpEx">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4056_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4056_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4056_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4056_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4056_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4056_Start3" name="Program stand-up; ongoing">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4056_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4056_Task4" name="OpEx/HR operate an accessible suggestion system (mobile/web) for frontline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OpEx/HR operate an accessible suggestion system (mobile/web) for frontline improvement ideas, route to the pipeline (W4052), and guarantee feedback to the submitter on disposition
Responsible (R): OpEx / HR / Comms
Accountable (A): COO / CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4056_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4056_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4056_Task5" name="OpEx/HR run Kaizen/rapid-improvement events and &quot;idea-to-action&quot; cycles at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OpEx/HR run Kaizen/rapid-improvement events and &quot;idea-to-action&quot; cycles at store/DC level, and celebrate wins visibly
Responsible (R): OpEx / Store &amp; DC Leadership
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4056_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4056_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4056_Task6" name="OpEx/HR recognize contributors (awards, tiered recognition) and report culture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OpEx/HR recognize contributors (awards, tiered recognition) and report culture metrics (ideas submitted/implemented, participation) to the executive team
Responsible (R): OpEx / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4056_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4056_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4056_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4056_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4056_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-629 (ensure controlled execution — OpEx Strategy, Governance &amp; Improvement Methodology (PA-133.1).) | - CTL-629: feedback SLA on every suggestion; recognition tied to realized benefit
Owner: COO / CHRO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
